keywords:
  - technology-assisted review
  - recall certification
  - confidence sequences
  - relevance assessment
  - active learning
abstract: >-
  Reproducible experiments for recall certification with fallible first-pass
  screening, adaptive targeted adjudication, and uniform reference audits.
  Includes normalized public review data, fixed configurations, certificate
  implementations, complete reference trajectories, paired statistical
  analyses, and CPU/GPU implementation checks.
